[size=4][b]AI disclosure and credits[/b][/size]
The implementation, scripts, and listing text were developed with OpenAI Codex in collaboration with Swiftfingers, with substantial AI-generated code. The illustrative mod icon was generated with OpenAI imagegen; its generation prompt is included in ARTWORK.txt. The gallery uses existing in-engine/game captures rather than the illustrated icon. Original project meshes and palettes are exported from the included Blender scene. Skeletons, animation controllers, equipment visuals, shaders, effects, and sounds are referenced from the installed Valheim game; no synthetic voice pack or extracted game asset pack is included.

Project source and original distributed artwork are MIT licensed; [url={{REPOSITORY_URL}}/blob/main/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md]third-party credits and rights[/url] apply. Bonehilda and Sims references are an unofficial fan tribute, with no affiliation to EA, Maxis, or Iron Gate.
